OL,3,GNEWSAMP brands bridge repair delays a
OL,4,A'total fiasco'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepairs to a 101-year-old bridge in
OL,7,FGrimsby have been branded a "total
OL,8,Ffiasco" by the town's MP after it
OL,9,Femerged there would be further delays
OL,10,Fto its reopening.
OL,12,FCorporation Bridge was closed in
OL,13,FFebruary 2023 for the work and has
OL,14,Ffaced several delays.
OL,16,FOliver Freeston, the leader of North
OL,17,FEast Lincolnshire Council, has now said
OL,18,Fthe bridge will not open before next
OL,19,FMay, at the earliest.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
